    "text": "frontierpartisans.com\nwebsite\nLancaster\nOld Gabe & A Full-Stock Hawken\n13 hours ago\nI warned you that August was going to play hell with our bankrolls. Another one for the Frontier Partisan library just went out to every trading post in the land…. You might ask whether we needed another Jim Bridger biography so close on the heels of the excellent Jim Bridger: Trailblazer of the American West by Jerry Enzler. I asked myself that question. But Markley’s book looks really good — and it is lavishly illustrated, and contains three maps, which is always appreciated.\n1",
